Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start by identifying the vacancy") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> converge(c1) -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n3,"advertise the vacancy again") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start by identifying the vacancy") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> converge(c1) -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n4,"proceed with selecting the appropriate applicant") -> action(n5,"appoint the candidate, process ends") -> end(e1)